## Services / 服務

- LPBF／SLM 金屬 3D 列印；最大成型尺寸 300 × 300 × 300 mm
- 一站式後處理：機械加工、雷射、水刀、拋光、焊接、鑄造、鍛造
- 其他製程：FDM、SLA、SLS
- 停產備品／Obsolete spare parts remanufacturing (tooling-free, low volume)

- LPBF / SLM metal 3D printing; max build size 300 × 300 × 300 mm
- One-stop post-processing: machining, laser, waterjet, polishing, welding, casting, forging
- Other processes: FDM, SLA, SLS
- Obsolete spare parts remanufacturing (tooling-free, low volume)

